1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,700
In a town in the Australian desert, you can hardly see any houses.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:08,150
That's because people dug into the hills and live underground.

3
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:11,500
Here, summer gets way over 40°C.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,350
But the underground homes stay in the low 20s °C all year.

5
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:19,350
They're cool without AC, and warm in winter without heating.

6
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:23,050
This was a mining town where people dug for opal gems.

7
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:26,600
The miners' tunnels became homes.

8
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:30,700
Now there's even an underground church, hotel, and bookstore.
